### Necessário para pegar o token
### Post
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:40000/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin"
}

### Seta o token
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

###

### sem token
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllServicos HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

###

### token inválido
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllServicos HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer token-invalido

###

### relacionamento inválido
POST http://localhost:40000/insertServico HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "clienteid": 999999,
    "titulo": "Serviço sem cliente",
    "descricao": "Não deve gravar",
    "valor": 100.00,
    "dataentrega": "2026-12-01"
}

